[Music]  hello my name is carolina i come from  the czech republic and i joined the  european court of auditors five years  ago  i completed my studies in the united  kingdom and after my studies i came to  work in luxembourg in banking before  joining the court  when i joined myself i was assigned a  mentor and a mentor is an experienced  auditor who is here to help you with  various questions  auditors are basically asked to swap  between the performance audit and the  financial audit after a certain period  of time which is great  [Music]  currently i am part of the revenue team  which  which audits revenue of the own  resources of the european union such as  vit for example  when auditing a specific eu policy or a  program like the erasmus exchange  program for instance it's like  completing different pieces of a jigsaw  of course because we need to install  confidence of people in the eu  policies and the work we do so i think  it's very important  definitely to have a financial  background i would say is an advantage  but it's definitely not just for people  with  finance expertise  i love luxembourg i believe it's a truly  international place to live and  people soon start feeling at home here  if you have what it takes then please  help us  apply and help us to run the eu better  [Music]

